From: ruscher <rruscher@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:26:13 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 175/178] Clip: A dock-app's Move Up/Down/Left/Right go cell by
 cell on the grid.

Into a free cell next to another icon, or swapping with the icon there.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
